  "text": "It sounds like you're feeling a lot of pressure from your advisor, and that can be really overwhelming. It's completely understandable that you might feel like you're walking on eggshells around her.\n\nSince you mentioned she tends to make things \"miserable,\" I want to gently suggest that maybe the way she communicates isn't necessarily about you being bad or failing, but rather about her own high standards or stress. Sometimes, people who are tough on the outside are actually trying to protect themselves or others from disappointment.\n\nWould you be willing to try setting those micro deadlines I mentioned earlier, even if it feels scary to reach out to her? Sometimes having a clear plan and small wins can help shift the dynamic, and it might give you a bit more confidence to talk to her about how you're feeling.",
